SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 CET: Culture Moves Europe: Call for Residency Hosts 
 2026-2027 (EUR 50/day per resident for hosting organisations)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 18 Jan 2027 at 23:59 CET.\n\nThe organisation-side stran
 d of Culture Moves Europe\, the EU's flagship mobility scheme for artists 
 and cultural professionals\, funds organisations to host artists in reside
 nce.\n\nOrganisation: Culture Moves Europe (Creative Europe\, European Com
 mission)\, implemented by the Goethe-Institut\nLocation: Legal entities re
 gistered in a Creative Europe country (including overseas countries and te
 rritories and outermost regions)\, hosting 1 to 5 residents from other Cre
 ative Europe countries.\nAward: Hosts: EUR 50 per day per resident plus ac
 cessibility support of EUR 375\, 675 or 1\,200 depending on residency leng
 th. Residents: EUR 30 per day\, travel allowance of EUR 400 (under 5\,000 
 km) or EUR 800\, and top-ups for green travel (EUR 400)\, OCT/outermost re
 gions (EUR 175)\, family (EUR 200 per child) and visa (EUR 120). No applic
 ation fee.\nDuration: Residencies from 12 April 2027 onward\; hosts choose
  residents and submit residency info between 9 March and 31 July 2027.\n\n
 More: https://culture.ec.europa.eu/culture-moves-europe/call-for-residency
 -hosts?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://culture.ec.europa.eu/culture-moves-europe/call-for-residency-ho
 sts?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Legal entities registered in a Creative Europe country (including 
 overseas countries and territories and outermost regions)\, hosting 1 to 5
  residents from other Creative Europe countries.
END:VEVENT
