 ommon Grounds.\n\nOrganisation: La Citadelle de Marseille (supported by th
 e Fondation Daniel et Nina Carasso)\nLocation: Fort d'Entrecasteaux (La Ci
 tadelle de Marseille)\, Marseille\, France. Applicants must live in Marsei
 lle or the surrounding area.\nAward: EUR 9\,000 excl. tax artist fee for t
 he whole period\, plus EUR 1\,400 for the co-creation workshops and EUR 60
 0 for community meetings and advocacy events (EUR 11\,000 in fees)\, and a
  production grant of up to EUR 5\,000 excl. tax. A workspace and a further
  EUR 5\,000 budget for guest speakers and event materials are covered by t
 he Citadelle. For a duo or collective the fees are paid once\, not per per
 son. No application fee stated.\nDuration: 6 months\, mid-April to mid-Oct
 ober 2027\n\nMore: https://citadelledemarseille.org/un-tiers-lieu-patrimon
 ial/projets-recherche-action/nous-les-sols?utm_source=artificialnouveaugra
